		<item>
		<title>Former WWE talent wins Jericho Cruise Oceanic Championship</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397180-former-wwe-talent-wins-jericho-cruise-oceanic-championship/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397180-former-wwe-talent-wins-jericho-cruise-oceanic-championship/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 04:17:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Misc. News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Jericho Cruise Oceanic Championship]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Rock N Wrestling Rager At Sea]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Santos Escobar]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397180</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Romeo Malverde revealed on Instagram that he has won the Jericho Cruise Oceanic Championship. Malverde, who has been&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397180-former-wwe-talent-wins-jericho-cruise-oceanic-championship/">Former WWE talent wins Jericho Cruise Oceanic Championship</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Romeo Malverde revealed on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/Dflak2DRhJX/">Instagram</a> that he has won the Jericho Cruise Oceanic Championship.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Malverde, who has been a free agent since his release in April ended his WWE run as Santos Escobar, defeated Mo Jabari during the course of Chris Jericho&#8217;s Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager at Sea to win the title after defeating Ricky Knight in a number one contender match to secure the title shot.</p>



<blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/p/Dflak2DRhJX/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" data-instgrm-version="14" style="background:#FFF;border:0;border-radius:3px;margin: 1px;max-width:540px;min-width:326px;padding:0;width:99.375%;width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px);width:calc(100% - 2px)"><div style="padding:16px"> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/Dflak2DRhJX/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" style="background:#FFFFFF;line-height:0;padding:0 0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;width:100%" target="_blank"> <div style="display: flex;flex-direction: row;align-items: center"> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 50%;flex-grow: 0;height: 40px;margin-right: 14px;width: 40px"></div> <div style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;flex-grow: 1;justify-content: center"> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 4px;flex-grow: 0;height: 14px;margin-bottom: 6px;width: 100px"></div> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 4px;flex-grow: 0;height: 14px;width: 60px"></div></div></div><div style="padding: 19% 0"></div> <div style="display:block;height:50px;margin:0 auto 12px;width:50px"></div><div style="padding-top: 8px"> <div style="color:#3897f0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:550;line-height:18px">View this post on Instagram</div></div><div style="padding: 12.5% 0"></div> <div style="display: flex;flex-direction: row;margin-bottom: 14px;align-items: center"><div> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 50%;height: 12.5px;width: 12.5px;transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px)"></div> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;height: 12.5px;transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px);width: 12.5px;flex-grow: 0;margin-right: 14px;margin-left: 2px"></div> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 50%;height: 12.5px;width: 12.5px;transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px)"></div></div><div style="margin-left: 8px"> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 50%;flex-grow: 0;height: 20px;width: 20px"></div> <div style="width: 0;height: 0;border-top: 2px solid transparent;border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4;border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)"></div></div><div style="margin-left: auto"> <div style="width: 0px;border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4;border-right: 8px solid transparent;transform: translateY(16px)"></div> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;flex-grow: 0;height: 12px;width: 16px;transform: translateY(-4px)"></div> <div style="width: 0;height: 0;border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4;border-left: 8px solid transparent;transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px)"></div></div></div> <div style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;flex-grow: 1;justify-content: center;margin-bottom: 24px"> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 4px;flex-grow: 0;height: 14px;margin-bottom: 6px;width: 224px"></div> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4;border-radius: 4px;flex-grow: 0;height: 14px;width: 144px"></div></div></a><p style="color:#c9c8cd;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:17px;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:8px;overflow:hidden;padding:8px 0 7px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/Dflak2DRhJX/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" style="color:#c9c8cd;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:17px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">A post shared by El Hijo del Fantasma Romeo Malverde (@escobarwwe)</a></p></div></blockquote>




<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://www.fightful.com/wrestling/romeo-malverde-santos-escobar-wins-jericho-cruise-oceanic-championship/">Fightful</a></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397180-former-wwe-talent-wins-jericho-cruise-oceanic-championship/">Former WWE talent wins Jericho Cruise Oceanic Championship</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
